CHAPTER SIXTEEN
IN THE HOG’S HEAD
ermione made no mention of Harry giving Defense Against the Dark
Arts lessons for two whole weeks after her original suggestion. Harry’s
detentions with Umbridge were finally over (he doubted whether the words
now etched on the back of his hand would ever fade entirely); Ron had had
