hag teaching us —”
“I meant the idea Ron and I had” — Ron cast her an alarmed, threatening
kind of look; she frowned at him — “oh, all right, the idea I had, then —
about you teaching us.”
Harry did not answer at once. He pretended to be perusing a page of Asiatic
Anti-Venoms, because he did not want to say what was in his mind.
The fact was that he had given the matter a great deal of thought over the
