“Er — right — thanks,” said Harry, just as the bell rang for break.
“No problem,” said Professor Grubbly-Plank gruffly, turning back into the
staffroom.
“Just a moment, Wilhelmina!” said Professor McGonagall. “Potter’s
letter!”
“Oh yeah!” said Harry, who had momentarily forgotten the scroll tied to
