“OUT!” roared a second voice.
Harry scrambled to his feet and looked around; they had arrived in the
gloomy basement kitchen of number twelve, Grimmauld Place. The only
sources of light were the fire and one guttering candle, which illuminated the
remains of a solitary supper. Kreacher was disappearing through the door to
the hall, looking back at them malevolently as he hitched up his loincloth;
