were buses rumbling along behind her and all the racket of a street full of
shoppers. Then he reminded himself that dummies could not hear anyway.
Next second his mouth opened in shock as the dummy gave a tiny nod,
beckoned its jointed finger, and Tonks had seized Ginny and Mrs. Weasley by
