Witches and wizards in lime-green robes were walking up and down the
rows, asking questions and making notes on clipboards like Umbridge’s.
Harry noticed the emblem embroidered on their chests: a wand and bone,
crossed.
“Are they doctors?” he asked Ron quietly.
“Doctors?” said Ron, looking startled. “Those Muggle nutters that cut
