“It’s these — ouch — shoes my brother gave me — ow — they’re eating
my — OUCH — feet — look at them, there must be some kind of —
AARGH — jinx on them and I can’t — AAAAARGH — get them off —”
He hopped from one foot to the other as though dancing on hot coals.
