Then they turned to each other, their smiles fading.
“We’ll save our news till tomorrow, shall we?” said Harry.
“Yes, all right,” said Hermione wearily. “I’m not in any hurry . . .”
They climbed the steps together. At the front doors both instinctively
looked back at the Forbidden Forest. Harry was not sure whether it was his
