others roared with rage and pawed the ground. “We consider that a great
insult, human! Our intelligence, thankfully, far outstrips your own —”
“What are you doing in our forest?” bellowed the hard-faced gray centaur
whom Harry and Hermione had seen on their last trip into the forest. “Why
are you here?”
“Your forest?” said Umbridge, shaking now not only with fright but also, it
