“Sirius,” Harry repeated, still gazing, mesmerized, at the continuously
swaying veil. “Yeah . . .”
And then something slid back into place in his brain: Sirius, captured,
bound, and tortured, and he was staring at this archway. . . .
He took several paces back from the dais and wrenched his eyes from the
