CHAPTER THIRTY-FIVE
BEYOND THE VEIL
lack shapes were emerging out of thin air all around them, blocking
their way left and right; eyes glinted through slits in hoods, a dozen lit
wand-tips were pointing directly at their hearts. Ginny gave a gasp of horror.
