“He’s here. I know he is.”
“The little baby woke up fwightened and fort what it dweamed was twoo,”
said the woman in a horrible, mock-baby voice. Harry felt Ron stir beside
him.
“Don’t do anything,” he muttered. “Not yet —”
The woman who had mimicked him let out a raucous scream of laughter.
“You hear him? You hear him? Giving instructions to the other children as
though he thinks of fighting us!”
