Transfiguration lesson with them both next day. They had just embarked upon
the immensely difficult topic of human Transfiguration; working in front of
mirrors, they were supposed to be changing the color of their own eyebrows.
Hermione laughed unkindly at Ron’s disastrous first attempt, during which he
